+## Goals
+
+### super-plan-ufz (root)
+Runs preserve work and evidence across interruptions, denied operations, and retries, and accurately report what remains before acceptance. Repairs address the confirmed failure mechanisms without adding a new workflow engine or expanding routine agent ceremony.
+
+### super-plan-ufz.8 — Preserve invocation findings until supported disposition
+Preserve actionable invocation-review findings and deferred findings across retries and interruptions until an explicit, supported disposition accounts for them. Keep the latest review verdict separate from outstanding findings.
+summary: Give super-code invocation review artifacts unique identities and retain unresolved findings across blocked/retried invocations.
+
